  "StockRole": "Society Frankenmech",
  "YangsThoughts": "Now this is one hell of a collection of hardware. A Society-spec iATM-12, Heavy Plasma Cannon, and Snub-Nose PPC, plus jump boosters and enough prototype cooling gear to keep the whole mess running - and somehow the Society even decided this thing was worth covering in Voidweave armor. That stuff's rare enough that I'm almost more worried about scratching the armor than getting shot.",
